# --- ESP-IDF generated output ---------------------------------------------
# Build tree and the component-manager download cache are fully regenerable.
#
# ⚠️ The leading slash is load-bearing. A bare `build/` matches a directory
# named build at ANY depth, which silently swallowed scripts/build/ — the
# ESP-IDF launchers documented in the README never made it into a commit.
# Same reasoning for `logs/` below.
/build/
/managed_components/
sdkconfig.old

# Recovered/corrupted Git metadata backups are local recovery material only.
.git.broken-*/

# --- Python bytecode caches ------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- 日志：不提交 -----------------------------------------------------------
# logs/ 里是串口抓取与伴生程序运行日志，带着本机的串口号、蓝牙地址和用户名
# 路径。只留在本地供排障与后续 AI 参考。
#   logs/serial/      串口抓取（boot*.log / cap_*.log / trace*.log …）
#   logs/companion/   伴生程序每日运行日志
# 末尾的 *.log 是兜底：任何散落在别处的日志同样不提交。
# 前导斜杠锚定到仓库根，理由同上面的 /build/。
/logs/
*.log

# --- 调试过程：默认不提交，两份参考材料例外 ---------------------------------
# debug/ 是「怎么定位、走了哪些弯路」的完整记录（**含失败路径**），带本机信息
# （串口号、蓝牙地址、用户名路径），默认不进仓库，只在本地保留供后续 AI 参考。
#   debug/README.md               索引：按现象查
#   debug/porting-log.md          移植踩坑 6.1–6.17（原 README 第 6 章）
#   debug/ble-troubleshooting.md  BLE 排障手册 7.1–7.5（原 README 第 7 章）
#   debug/ui-replace.md           表盘换肤契约
#   debug/tmp/                    历史素材与草稿
#
# 但下面两份是**参考材料**而不是调试日志，要留在仓库里（重组前就是跟踪状态）：
#   debug/session-2026-09-25.md   两轮「连上但功能受限」的完整定位记录
#   debug/reference/devcomm.js    桌面端 wl_device_comm 打包产物，核对 HID 分帧用
#
# ⚠️ 这里必须写 `debug/*` 而不是 `debug/`。带尾斜杠会把目录**本身**排除掉，
# git 便不再向下遍历，后面所有 `!` 取反一律失效 —— 官方原话是
# "It is not possible to re-include a file if a parent directory of that file
# is excluded"。`debug/*` 只排除直接子项，目录本身仍可遍历，白名单才生效。
debug/*
!debug/reference/
!debug/reference/devcomm.js
!debug/session-2026-09-25.md

# --- Local, machine-specific state ----------------------------------------
# Serial-port/device bindings, host bridge state, recovery images.
.local/
*.local.json

# --- Assistant working notes ----------------------------------------------
# Per-session debugging logs and project memory. Kept on disk, never shared:
# they name this machine's ports, addresses and dead ends.
.workbuddy-ai/

# --- UI replacement kit ----------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling for swapping the dashboard art. Kept out of the tree so a
# restyle never lands in a commit by accident. Its contract lives in
# debug/ui-replace.md, which is ignored along with the rest of debug/.
scripts/assets/apply_ui_assets.py
